Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"etcd__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">2013 年由 CoreOS 发布；2020 年 CNCF 毕业 社区共识。 Kubernetes 的默认元数据存储，间接装机量极大 社区共识。 治理中立，长期维护有保障；但功能演进保守 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>2013 年由 CoreOS 发布；2020 年 CNCF 毕业 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 的默认元数据存储，间接装机量极大 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>治理中立，长期维护有保障；但功能演进保守 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Released 2013 by CoreOS; CNCF graduated 2020 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Kubernetes&#x27; default metadata store — enormous indirect install base <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Neutral gov…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Released 2013 by CoreOS; CNCF graduated 2020 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Kubernetes&#x27; default metadata store — enormous indirect install base <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Neutral governance with assured long-term maintenance; conservative feature evolution <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">所有 Kubernetes 集群默认用 etcd 存元数据（公开）社区共识。 直接把 etcd 当业务 KV 用的公开案例少 社区共识。 云厂商托管 k8s behind the scenes 大规模使用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>所有 Kubernetes 集群默认用 etcd 存元数据（公开）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>直接把 etcd 当业务 KV 用的公开案例少 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>云厂商托管 k8s  behind the scenes 大规模使用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Every Kubernetes cluster uses etcd for metadata by default (public) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Few public cases use etcd directly as a business KV store <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Every Kubernetes cluster uses etcd for metadata by default (public) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Few public cases use etcd directly as a business KV store <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud managed-Kubernetes offerings run it at scale behind the scenes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">备份：etcdctl snapshot save/restore，简单可靠 官方文档。 无 CDC/迁移工具概念（KV 语义简单）；监控：Prometheus metrics 内置 官方文档。 工具链薄是定位决定的，不是缺点 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>备份：etcdctl snapshot save/restore，简单可靠 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 CDC/迁移工具概念（KV 语义简单）；监控：Prometheus metrics 内置 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>工具链薄是定位决定的，不是缺点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">Backup: etcdctl snapshot save/restore — simple and reliable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No CDC/migration-tooling concept (simple KV semantics); monitoring via built-in Prometheus me…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Backup: etcdctl snapshot save/restore — simple and reliable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No CDC/migration-tooling concept (simple KV semantics); monitoring via built-in Prometheus metrics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The thin toolchain follows from its scope, not a weakness <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">无官方托管服务 社区共识。 Aiven 等第三方提供托管 etcd 社区共识。 实践中多随 Kubernetes 托管版间接使用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无官方托管服务 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Aiven 等第三方提供托管 etcd <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>实践中多随 Kubernetes 托管版间接使用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">No official managed service <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Third parties (e.g. Aiven) offer managed etcd <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. In practice mostly consumed indirectly via managed…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No official managed service <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Third parties (e.g. Aiven) offer managed etcd <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>In practice mostly consumed indirectly via managed Kubernetes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 存配置/元数据 KV，不是数据平台，无批量导入工具 官方文档。 数据恢复靠 snapshot restore，不是摄入通道 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd 存配置/元数据 KV，不是数据平台，无批量导入工具 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>数据恢复靠 snapshot restore，不是摄入通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd stores config/metadata KVs, not a data platform; no bulk import tooling <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Recovery is via snapshot restore, not an ingest channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd stores config/metadata KVs, not a data platform; no bulk import tooling <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Recovery is via snapshot restore, not an ingest channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（查证为无）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd server 自身没有审计日志功能：谁在何时读写了哪个 key，etcd 不记录。K8s 场景的审计靠 kube-apiserver 的 audit log。 选型含义：合规要求操作留痕时，etcd 只能依赖前置代理/网关或主机层审计，原生能力是空白。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>etcd server 自身<strong>没有审计日志功能</strong>：谁在何时读写了哪个 key，etcd 不记录。K8s 场景的审计靠 kube-apiserver 的 audit log。 <strong>选型含义</strong>：合规要求操作留痕时，etcd 只能依赖前置代理/网关或主机层审计，原生能力是空白。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">no audit-logging functionality</span><p class=\"snippet\">The etcd server itself has no audit-logging functionality: who read or wrote which key at what time is not recorded by etcd. In Kubernetes scenarios, auditing relies on k…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>The etcd server itself has <strong>no audit-logging functionality</strong>: who read or wrote which key at what time is not recorded by etcd. In Kubernetes scenarios, auditing relies on kube-apiserver&#x27;s audit log. <strong>Selection implication</strong>: when compliance requires an audit trail of operations, etcd can only rely on a front proxy/gateway or host-level auditing — native capability is a blank.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（无查询引擎，无外部数据访问概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">KV API 只读写自身数据，无联邦查询/外部表 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>KV API 只读写自身数据，无联邦查询/外部表 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">The KV API only reads/writes its own data; no federated queries or external tables <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The KV API only reads/writes its own data; no federated queries or external tables <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Watch API 提供 key 前缀/范围的变更通知，可做轻量订阅 官方文档。 无变更日志持久化、无 exactly-once 语义，不等于 CDC 社区共识。 历史版本可通过 revision 回看，但保留期有限 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Watch API 提供 key 前缀/范围的变更通知，可做轻量订阅 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无变更日志持久化、无 exactly-once 语义，不等于 CDC <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>历史版本可通过 revision 回看，但保留期有限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">The Watch API notifies on key prefix/range changes; usable as a lightweight subscription <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No durable change log, no exactly-once semantics — not CDC (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The Watch API notifies on key prefix/range changes; usable as a lightweight subscription <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No durable change log, no exactly-once semantics — not CDC <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Past revisions are readable via revision, with limited retention <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（key 租约（lease）TTL，</span><p class=\"snippet\">key 可绑定 lease，lease 过期则 key 自动删除，是原生设计 官方文档。 lease 需客户端 keepalive 续约，网络分区时可能误删 社区共识。 定位是元数据/配置存储，不适合海量业务数据过期 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>key 可绑定 lease，lease 过期则 key 自动删除，是原生设计 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>lease 需客户端 keepalive 续约，网络分区时可能误删 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>定位是元数据/配置存储，不适合海量业务数据过期 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Keys attach to leases; lease expiry auto-deletes the keys — native by design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Leases need client keepalive; network partitions can cause premature deletio…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Keys attach to leases; lease expiry auto-deletes the keys — native by design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Leases need client keepalive; network partitions can cause premature deletion <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Built for metadata/config, not bulk business-data expiry <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">纯 KV，无表结构，无 DDL 概念 官方文档。 数据格式变更由应用版本管理，与存储无关 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>纯 KV，无表结构，无 DDL 概念 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>数据格式变更由应用版本管理，与存储无关 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">Pure KV, no table structure, no DDL concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Data-format changes are managed by app versioning, unrelated to storage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Pure KV, no table structure, no DDL concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Data-format changes are managed by app versioning, unrelated to storage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（元数据存储，无租户资源概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">定位是集群元数据/配置存储，无多租户资源隔离设计 官方文档。 quota 后端字节数是全局的，不是租户级 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>定位是集群元数据/配置存储，无多租户资源隔离设计 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>quota 后端字节数是全局的，不是租户级 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">Built for cluster metadata/config; no multi-tenant resource isolation design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The backend-bytes quota is global, not per-tenant <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Built for cluster metadata/config; no multi-tenant resource isolation design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The backend-bytes quota is global, not per-tenant <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft 强一致要求低延迟，跨区部署延迟爆炸 官方文档。 定位是单 region 集群元数据存储 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Raft 强一致要求低延迟，跨区部署延迟爆炸 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>定位是单 region 集群元数据存储 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft&#x27;s strong consistency needs low latency; cross-region latency explodes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Built as single-region cluster metadata storage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Raft&#x27;s strong consistency needs low latency; cross-region latency explodes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built as single-region cluster metadata storage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（Raft 选主，秒级恢复）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft 多副本，leader 故障秒级重选，RPO=0 官方文档。 推荐 3/5 节点，偶数节点无意义 官方文档。 磁盘延迟是 leader 选举抖动常见根因 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Raft 多副本，leader 故障秒级重选，RPO=0 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>推荐 3/5 节点，偶数节点无意义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>磁盘延迟是 leader 选举抖动常见根因 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft multi-replica; leader failure triggers re-election in seconds, RPO=0 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 3/5 nodes recommended; even counts are pointless <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Disk latency …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Raft multi-replica; leader failure triggers re-election in seconds, RPO=0 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>3/5 nodes recommended; even counts are pointless <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Disk latency is the classic cause of election flapping <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（KV存储，无行列安全概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 是分布式 KV 存储，无行 / 列概念，原生无 RLS、列级权限与脱敏 官方文档 RBAC 只到 key 前缀 / 范围级别，是唯一的隔离手段 官方文档 敏感值只能靠客户端加密 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd 是分布式 KV 存储，无行 / 列概念，原生无 RLS、列级权限与脱敏 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>RBAC 只到 key 前缀 / 范围级别，是唯一的隔离手段 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>敏感值只能靠客户端加密 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd is a distributed KV store with no row/column concept; natively no RLS, column privileges, or masking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> RBAC stops at key-prefix / range level and is th…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd is a distributed KV store with no row/column concept; natively no RLS, column privileges, or masking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>RBAC stops at key-prefix / range level and is the only isolation mechanism <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Sensitive values can only be protected with client-side encryption <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 字节值，无 JSON 语义）</span><p class=\"snippet\">value 为不透明字节，etcd 不解析 JSON（不适用）官方文档。 如需 JSON 语义在客户端序列化/反序列化 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>value 为不透明字节，etcd 不解析 JSON（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>如需 JSON 语义在客户端序列化/反序列化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">Values are opaque bytes; etcd does not parse JSON (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Serialize/deserialize JSON client-side if needed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Values are opaque bytes; etcd does not parse JSON (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Serialize/deserialize JSON client-side if needed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 无全文检索概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">无全文检索概念（不适用）官方文档。 键前缀查询（prefix/range）是其检索方式 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无全文检索概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>键前缀查询（prefix/range）是其检索方式 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">No full-text concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Key prefix/range queries are its retrieval model <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No full-text concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Key prefix/range queries are its retrieval model <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">有 RBAC：user/role 模型，权限粒度为 key 范围（range）读写，认证方式为密码或 TLS 客户端证书 CN；root 用户为超级用户，需先建 root 再 etcdctl auth enable。 缺口：① 默认关闭，K8s 默认部署也不启用（靠网络隔离+证书）；② 粒度只到 key 前缀，无字段级、无行级；③ 无 L…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>有 RBAC：user/role 模型，权限粒度为 <strong>key 范围（range）读写</strong>，认证方式为密码或 TLS 客户端证书 CN；<code>root</code> 用户为超级用户，需先建 root 再 <code>etcdctl auth enable</code>。 <strong>缺口</strong>：① 默认关闭，K8s 默认部署也不启用（靠网络隔离+证书）；② 粒度只到 key 前缀，无字段级、无行级；③ 无 LDAP/OIDC 原生集成；④ 权限绕过出过 CVE（嵌套 Txn 绕过 RBAC 检查 CVE-2026-33343，v3.5.28 修复；watch 越权 GHSA-xg4h-6gfc-h4m8，v3.6.14 修复）。 <strong>机制一句话</strong>：鉴权在 v3rpc 层按 key range 做允许/拒绝判断，简单但粗。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Has RBAC: user/role model, permission granularity at key range read/write, authentication via password or TLS client-certificate CN; the root user is the superuser, requi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Has RBAC: user/role model, permission granularity at <strong>key range read/write</strong>, authentication via password or TLS client-certificate CN; the <code>root</code> user is the superuser, requiring root to be created first and then <code>etcdctl auth enable</code>. <strong>Gaps</strong>: ① disabled by default, and not enabled in default Kubernetes deployments either (relying on network isolation + certificates); ② granularity only reaches key prefixes — no field-level, no row-level; ③ no native LDAP/OIDC integration; ④ authorization bypasses have had CVEs (nested Txn bypassing RBAC checks, CVE-2026-33343, fixed in v3.5.28; watch privilege escalation GHSA-xg4h-6gfc-h4m8, fixed in v3.6.14). <strong>Mechanism in one line</strong>: authorization does allow/deny decisions per key range at the v3rpc layer — simple but coarse.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">底层 bbolt 为 B+tree 结构，无数据压缩机制，快照文件体积较大。官方文档 快照与 WAL 保留策略可配置以控制磁盘占用，但属运维手段而非压缩。官方文档 元数据场景数据量小，压缩缺失影响有限；大数据量场景不建议用 etcd。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>底层 bbolt 为 B+tree 结构，无数据压缩机制，快照文件体积较大。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>快照与 WAL 保留策略可配置以控制磁盘占用，但属运维手段而非压缩。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>元数据场景数据量小，压缩缺失影响有限；大数据量场景不建议用 etcd。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">The underlying bbolt store is B+tree based with no data-compression mechanism; snapshot files are large. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Snapshot and WAL retention policies are configura…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The underlying bbolt store is B+tree based with no data-compression mechanism; snapshot files are large. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Snapshot and WAL retention policies are configurable to bound disk usage, but that is operational control, not compression. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Metadata workloads are small, so missing compression matters little; etcd is not recommended for large data volumes. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 采用 Apache 2.0 开源，为 CNCF 毕业项目，社区治理成熟。官方文档 无协议变更黑历史；作为 Kubernetes 默认元数据存储，生态绑定的是开放标准而非厂商。社区共识 任何兼容实现均可替换，无商业锁定。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd 采用 Apache 2.0 开源，为 CNCF 毕业项目，社区治理成熟。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无协议变更黑历史；作为 Kubernetes 默认元数据存储，生态绑定的是开放标准而非厂商。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>任何兼容实现均可替换，无商业锁定。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd is open source under Apache 2.0 and a CNCF graduated project with mature community governance. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> No license-change history; as Kubernetes&#x27; default meta…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd is open source under Apache 2.0 and a CNCF graduated project with mature community governance. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No license-change history; as Kubernetes&#x27; default metadata store, the ecosystem binds to an open standard, not a vendor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Any compatible implementation can replace it; no commercial lock-in. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 存储无查询优化器）</span><p class=\"snippet\">纯 KV 读写，无查询计划概念 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>纯 KV 读写，无查询计划概念 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">Pure KV reads/writes; no query-plan concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Pure KV reads/writes; no query-plan concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（参数少：配额与压缩是调优点）</span><p class=\"snippet\">参数精简，核心是 backend quota、compaction 周期 官方文档。 大 value/高频 watch 是典型调优场景 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>参数精简，核心是 backend quota、compaction 周期 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大 value/高频 watch 是典型调优场景 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">quota and compacti</span><p class=\"snippet\">Lean parameters; the levers are backend quota and compaction intervals <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Large values and high-frequency watches are the classic tuning cases (community co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Lean parameters; the levers are backend quota and compaction intervals <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Large values and high-frequency watches are the classic tuning cases <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">底层 bbolt 仅元数据页带校验，数据页无页级 checksum，损坏可能静默。社区实测 etcd 有实验性的损坏检测与告警（如 corrupt check），但覆盖有限。官方文档 生产实践多靠 quorum 多数派 + 快照重建坏成员，而非页级自愈。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>底层 bbolt 仅元数据页带校验，数据页无页级 checksum，损坏可能静默。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>etcd 有实验性的损坏检测与告警（如 corrupt check），但覆盖有限。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>生产实践多靠 quorum 多数派 + 快照重建坏成员，而非页级自愈。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">The underlying bbolt checks only meta pages; data pages have no page-level checksum, so corruption can be silent. (community tested) etcd ships experimental corruption de…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The underlying bbolt checks only meta pages; data pages have no page-level checksum, so corruption can be silent. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>etcd ships experimental corruption detection and alerting (e.g. corrupt check) with limited coverage. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Production practice leans on quorum majority plus snapshot rebuilds of bad members, not page-level self-healing. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 无过程语言概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">无存储过程/触发器概念（不适用）官方文档。 事务为多 key 原子 compare-and-swap，非过程逻辑 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无存储过程/触发器概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>事务为多 key 原子 compare-and-swap，非过程逻辑 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">No stored-procedure/trigger concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Transactions are multi-key atomic compare-and-swap, not procedural logic <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No stored-procedure/trigger concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Transactions are multi-key atomic compare-and-swap, not procedural logic <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 无约束概念（不适用））</span><p class=\"snippet\">无外键/CHECK/唯一约束概念（不适用）官方文档。 一致性靠 Raft 与租约（lease），非数据完整性约束 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无外键/CHECK/唯一约束概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>一致性靠 Raft 与租约（lease），非数据完整性约束 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">No FK/CHECK/unique concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Consistency via Raft and leases, not data-integrity constraints <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No FK/CHECK/unique concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Consistency via Raft and leases, not data-integrity constraints <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 无 SQL/分析概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">无 SQL，更无分析 SQL（不适用）官方文档。 运维分析靠监控指标而非查询 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无 SQL，更无分析 SQL（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>运维分析靠监控指标而非查询 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">No SQL, let alone analytical SQL (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Operational insight via metrics, not queries <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No SQL, let alone analytical SQL (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Operational insight via metrics, not queries <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 是 MVCC 存储：删除只是追加 tombstone 修订，旧版本在压缩（compaction）前仍可读 官方文档 需定期 compaction + defrag 才能物理回收；后端 bbolt 文件历史页可能残留 社区实测 快照备份保留被删数据的历史状态 社区共识 无擦除证明 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd 是 MVCC 存储：删除只是追加 tombstone 修订，旧版本在压缩（compaction）前仍可读 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>需定期 compaction + defrag 才能物理回收；后端 bbolt 文件历史页可能残留 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>快照备份保留被删数据的历史状态 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd is MVCC storage: deletion only appends a tombstone revision, and old versions stay readable until compaction <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Periodic compaction plus defrag is neede…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd is MVCC storage: deletion only appends a tombstone revision, and old versions stay readable until compaction <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Periodic compaction plus defrag is needed for physical reclamation; backend bbolt file history pages may retain data <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>Snapshot backups preserve historical states of deleted data <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 元数据存储，无血缘概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">定位是分布式 KV/配置中心，无数据血缘概念 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>定位是分布式 KV/配置中心，无数据血缘概念 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">A distributed KV/config store; no data-lineage concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>A distributed KV/config store; no data-lineage concept <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">备份：etcdctl snapshot save 在线对单成员取一致性快照。恢复：v3.6 起 etcdctl snapshot restore/status 已移除，改由 etcdutl 承担离线恢复；恢复本质是停机重建——用快照起一个新集群（或作为新成员加入），不支持在线单 key/表级恢复、不支持 PITR。恢复速度取决于快照大小与…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>备份：<code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> 在线对单成员取一致性快照。恢复：v3.6 起 <code>etcdctl snapshot restore/status</code> 已移除，改由 <strong><code>etcdutl</code></strong> 承担离线恢复；恢复本质是<strong>停机重建</strong>——用快照起一个新集群（或作为新成员加入），不支持在线单 key/表级恢复、不支持 PITR。恢复速度取决于快照大小与成员重放 WAL 的速度。 <strong>机制一句话</strong>：快照=bbolt 文件拷贝级备份，恢复=重建集群，没有逻辑备份/增量备份概念。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Backup: etcdctl snapshot save takes a consistent snapshot online against a single member. Restore: starting with v3.6, etcdctl snapshot restore/status was removed and off…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Backup: <code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> takes a consistent snapshot online against a single member. Restore: starting with v3.6, <code>etcdctl snapshot restore/status</code> was removed and offline restore is now handled by <strong><code>etcdutl</code></strong>; restore is fundamentally <strong>downtime rebuild</strong> — bootstrap a new cluster from the snapshot (or join it as a new member); no online single-key/table-level restore, no PITR. Restore speed depends on snapshot size and how fast members replay WAL. <strong>Mechanism in one line</strong>: snapshot = bbolt-file-level-copy backup; restore = rebuild the cluster; there is no notion of logical or incremental backup.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft 共识 + bbolt 本地存储，典型存算一体 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Raft 共识 + bbolt 本地存储，典型存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Raft + bbolt local</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft consensus + bbolt local storage; classically coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Raft consensus + bbolt local storage; classically coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（纯 KV，无多模）</span><p class=\"snippet\">仅 KV 模型 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>仅 KV 模型 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">KV model only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>KV model only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（基础设施组件，无计费概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 是 Kubernetes 等系统的基础设施组件，无内置计费，成本并入集群硬件与运维人力。社区共识 托管 Kubernetes 服务的控制面成本通常打包在集群费用中。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd 是 Kubernetes 等系统的基础设施组件，无内置计费，成本并入集群硬件与运维人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>托管 Kubernetes 服务的控制面成本通常打包在集群费用中。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd is infrastructure for systems like Kubernetes with no built-in metering; cost folds into cluster hardware and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Managed Kuberne…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>etcd is infrastructure for systems like Kubernetes with no built-in metering; cost folds into cluster hardware and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Managed Kubernetes services typically bundle control-plane cost into the cluster fee. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">gRPC API，官方 Go/Java/Python 客户端 官方文档。 无 JDBC/ODBC（KV 定位不需要）社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>gRPC API，官方 Go/Java/Python 客户端 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 JDBC/ODBC（KV 定位不需要）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Go/Java/Python)</span><p class=\"snippet\">gRPC API with official Go/Java/Python clients <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No JDBC/ODBC (unneeded for KV) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>gRPC API with official Go/Java/Python clients <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No JDBC/ODBC (unneeded for KV) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用（KV 无物化视图概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">无物化视图概念（不适用）官方文档。 缓存/配置场景不需要预聚合 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无物化视图概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>缓存/配置场景不需要预聚合 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">No materialized-view concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cache/config use cases need no pre-aggregation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No materialized-view concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cache/config use cases need no pre-aggregation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">开源 CNCF 项目，任意环境可部署 官方文档。 跨云部署无意义（Raft 延迟敏感），单云/单区是常态 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>开源 CNCF 项目，任意环境可部署 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云部署无意义（Raft 延迟敏感），单云/单区是常态 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Open-source CNCF project; deploys anywhere <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cross-cloud deployment is pointless (Raft is latency-sensitive); single-cloud/region is the norm (community co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Open-source CNCF project; deploys anywhere <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud deployment is pointless (Raft is latency-sensitive); single-cloud/region is the norm <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">并发控制原语是 Raft 全局串行写 + MVCC：所有写经 leader 提交后按全局 revision 顺序应用，每 key 保留多版本；同一 key 的并发写不存在&quot;冲突&quot;概念，只有先后顺序，无锁等待、无 abort、无需重试（重试归属：不适用，串行化消除了冲突）。需要 CAS 语义时用 Txn 的 If/Then 对 mod_re…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>并发控制原语是 Raft 全局串行写 + MVCC：所有写经 leader 提交后按全局 revision 顺序应用，每 key 保留多版本；同一 key 的并发写不存在&quot;冲突&quot;概念，只有先后顺序，无锁等待、无 abort、无需重试（重试归属：不适用，串行化消除了冲突）。需要 CAS 语义时用 Txn 的 If/Then 对 mod_revision 做比较，条件失败整体返回、由应用按业务语义决定是否重试。衰减不来自冲突，而来自版本堆积。无内置冲突检测机制（设计使然）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态：每次写（哪怕同一 key）都产生新全局 revision、bbolt 新条目，并经 Raft 多数派 fsync 落盘；热点 key 高频更新使该 key 的版本链与 bbolt 持续膨胀，历史 revision 读与压缩成本上升；后端配额默认 2GB（<code>--quota-backend-bytes</code>，官方建议上限 8GB）耗尽即触发 NOSPACE 告警、整个集群转只读，且删除数据后仍只读，必须人工 compact + defrag + 清告警才能恢复。单点瓶颈是 leader 单机磁盘 fsync 能力（约万级写/秒量级），加节点不加写吞吐<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解（有限）：未找到官方命名或文档化的热点识别、限流、打散或排队化机制的证据（不是查证为无）；自动压缩（<code>--auto-compaction-mode=revision/periodic</code>，3.x 即有）定期丢弃旧版本，属于卫生机制而非热点打散——不压缩的后果就是配额耗尽转只读。应用层模式：高频计数器、事件流等热点数据按设计定位就不应进 etcd（它是低频协调状态存储），必须进时用 lease 做短暂 key、单 value 不超过 1.5MB（<code>--max-request-bytes</code>，超限直接拒绝），代价是把业务状态搬到消息队列或时序库的架构成本<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：watch 热点 key 的客户端会被每次更新唤醒，热点写放大为通知风暴，慢消费者拖慢整体，背压由应用层处理（内核无背压排队）；磁盘变慢会导致 leader 心跳超时、频繁选主，写延迟从毫秒级跌到秒级——协调代价随争用超线性增长。重试归属：watch 断开由客户端重连，写失败由应用重试。应用层模式：热点 key 的 watcher 侧做聚合节流（代价：通知实时性下降）；生产实践建议：单 key 高频更新建议控制在约 1000 QPS 以内（待验证：整体写速率的稳定性指引有社区出处，单 key 口径尚无确切出处），超限则 revision 膨胀与压缩成本急剧上升<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">The concurrency primitive is Raft-serialized writes plus MVCC: every write commits through the leader and applies in global revision order, with multiple versions kept pe…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is Raft-serialized writes plus MVCC: every write commits through the leader and applies in global revision order, with multiple versions kept per key. Concurrent writes to the same key have no &quot;conflict&quot; concept — only ordering — so there is no lock waiting, no abort, and no retry (retry ownership: not applicable, serialization eliminates conflicts). CAS semantics use a Txn If/Then comparing mod_revision; a failed condition returns the whole transaction and the application decides whether to retry. Decay comes from version accumulation, not conflicts. There is no built-in conflict detection (by design) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Decay shape: every write, even to the same key, mints a new global revision plus a new bbolt entry and fsyncs through a Raft quorum. A hot key&#x27;s high-frequency updates inflate that key&#x27;s version chain and bbolt indefinitely, raising historical-revision read and compaction costs. Exhausting the backend quota (default 2GB via <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code>, 8GB max recommended) raises a NOSPACE alarm and turns the whole cluster read-only — and it stays read-only after deletions until an operator manually compacts, defragments, and clears the alarm. The single-point bottleneck is the leader&#x27;s disk fsync capacity (on the order of ten thousand writes/sec); adding members does not add write throughput <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation (limited): no evidence found for an officially named or documented hotspot detection, rate-limiting, spreading, or queueing mechanism (not verified absent). Auto-compaction (<code>--auto-compaction-mode=revision/periodic</code>, present since 3.x) periodically discards old versions — hygiene, not hotspot spreading; skipping compaction ends in quota exhaustion and read-only mode. The application pattern: hot data like high-frequency counters or event streams does not belong in etcd by design (it is a low-frequency coordination store); if it must, use short-lived lease keys and keep each value under 1.5MB (<code>--max-request-bytes</code>, oversized requests are rejected outright), at the cost of moving business state to a queue or time-series store (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Boundaries: clients watching a hot key are woken on every update, amplifying hotspot writes into a notification storm, and slow consumers drag the whole system down — backpressure is the application&#x27;s job (the core has no backpressure queueing). A slow disk causes leader heartbeat timeouts and repeated elections, collapsing write latency from milliseconds to seconds — coordination cost grows superlinearly with contention. Retry ownership: watch disconnects reconnect client-side, write failures retry application-side. The application pattern: aggregate and throttle on the watcher side of hot keys (cost: reduced notification freshness). Production guidance: keep high-frequency updates to a single key within roughly 1,000 QPS (to be verified: the stability guideline is documented for overall write rates; no exact source for a single-key figure) — beyond that, revision bloat and compaction costs spike sharply <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">/metrics 暴露 Prometheus 指标（--metrics=extensive 开全量：Raft、WAL fsync、mvcc、watcher 等）；etcdctl endpoint health/status 看成员健康与 db 大小；etcdctl check perf 做写入压测；3.6 新增 /livez /ready…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><code>/metrics</code> 暴露 Prometheus 指标（<code>--metrics=extensive</code> 开全量：Raft、WAL fsync、mvcc、watcher 等）；<code>etcdctl endpoint health/status</code> 看成员健康与 db 大小；<code>etcdctl check perf</code> 做写入压测；3.6 新增 <code>/livez</code> <code>/readyz</code>（对齐 K8s 探针语义）与 Kubernetes 风格 feature gates；<code>--enable-pprof</code>；3.6 引入 OpenTelemetry 追踪。 <strong>关键指标</strong>：<code>etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds</code> p99（&gt;10ms 即危险）、<code>etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total</code>、dbSize/dbSizeInUse。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p class=\"snippet\">/metrics exposes Prometheus metrics (--metrics=extensive enables the full set: Raft, WAL fsync, mvcc, watcher, etc.); etcdctl endpoint health/status checks member health …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><code>/metrics</code> exposes Prometheus metrics (<code>--metrics=extensive</code> enables the full set: Raft, WAL fsync, mvcc, watcher, etc.); <code>etcdctl endpoint health/status</code> checks member health and db size; <code>etcdctl check perf</code> runs write load tests; 3.6 added <code>/livez</code> <code>/readyz</code> (aligned with Kubernetes probe semantics) and Kubernetes-style feature gates; <code>--enable-pprof</code>; 3.6 introduced OpenTelemetry tracing. <strong>Key metrics</strong>: <code>etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds</code> p99 (&gt;10ms is dangerous), <code>etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total</code>, dbSize/dbSizeInUse.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（gRPC 长连接）</span><p class=\"snippet\">2379 端口 gRPC（HTTP/2 多路复用），单连接承载多 stream；clientv3 支持多 endpoint 配置与 round-robin 负载均衡、断线重连；watch 是长生命周期 server-stream。连接开销低，不需要也不建议应用层连接池（一个 client 实例复用即可）。 注意：watch 数量直接转化为…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>2379 端口 gRPC（HTTP/2 多路复用），单连接承载多 stream；clientv3 支持多 endpoint 配置与 round-robin 负载均衡、断线重连；watch 是<strong>长生命周期 server-stream</strong>。连接开销低，不需要也不建议应用层连接池（一个 client 实例复用即可）。 <strong>注意</strong>：watch 数量直接转化为服务端内存与 fanout 开销（见深水区二）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">gRPC on port 2379 (HTTP/2 multiplexing), multiple streams over a single connection; clientv3 supports multi-endpoint configuration with round-robin load balancing and rec…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>gRPC on port 2379 (HTTP/2 multiplexing), multiple streams over a single connection; clientv3 supports multi-endpoint configuration with round-robin load balancing and reconnect-on-failure; watch is a <strong>long-lived server-stream</strong>. Connection overhead is low — no application-level connection pool is needed or recommended (reuse one client instance). <strong>Note</strong>: watch count translates directly into server-side memory and fanout cost (see deep-dive II).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（KV 语义的事务）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 的&quot;事务&quot;= Txn：If（多条件比较）/Then/Else 原子执行，单 Raft round-trip 内对多 key 做 CAS（比较维度：value/version/createRevision/modRevision/lease）。 隔离级别：写一律线性一致（经 leader + quorum + WAL fsync）…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>etcd 的&quot;事务&quot;= <strong>Txn：If（多条件比较）/Then/Else 原子执行</strong>，单 Raft round-trip 内对多 key 做 CAS（比较维度：value/version/createRevision/modRevision/lease）。 <strong>隔离级别</strong>：写一律线性一致（经 leader + quorum + WAL fsync）；读分两档——linearizable（默认走 quorum/ReadIndex）与 serializable（leader 本地读，可能读到旧值但不加延迟）。 <strong>没有</strong>多语句交互式事务、没有回滚段、没有关系型意义上的隔离级别矩阵；客户端 STM（如 Go concurrency 包、Node 的 microsoft/etcd3 的 software transactional memory）是<strong>基于 Txn 在客户端拼出的乐观并发</strong>，不等同于服务端事务。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd&#x27;s &quot;transaction&quot; = Txn: If (multi-condition comparisons) / Then / Else executed atomically, performing CAS (compare-and-swap) across multiple keys within a single Raf…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>etcd&#x27;s &quot;transaction&quot; = <strong>Txn: If (multi-condition comparisons) / Then / Else executed atomically</strong>, performing CAS (compare-and-swap) across multiple keys within a single Raft round-trip (comparison dimensions: value/version/createRevision/modRevision/lease). <strong>Isolation levels</strong>: all writes are linearizable (via leader + quorum + WAL fsync); reads come in two grades — linearizable (default, goes through quorum/ReadIndex) and serializable (leader local read; may return stale values but adds no latency). <strong>What it doesn&#x27;t have</strong>: multi-statement interactive transactions, no rollback segments, no relational-style isolation-level matrix; client-side STM (e.g., the Go concurrency package, Node&#x27;s microsoft/etcd3 software transactional memory) is <strong>optimistic concurrency assembled client-side on top of Txn</strong> — not equivalent to server-side transactions.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft（etcd-io/raft 独立库）：所有写经 leader 写 WAL 并 fsync 后复制到多数派才提交；CP 系统，分区时少数派侧写不可用、线性一致读失败，不存在脑裂写。读优化：leader 租约读（lease-based read）避免每次读都走 quorum。成员变更走 Raft conf change，支持 lear…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Raft（etcd-io/raft 独立库）：所有写经 leader 写 WAL 并 fsync 后复制到多数派才提交；<strong>CP 系统</strong>，分区时少数派侧写不可用、线性一致读失败，<strong>不存在脑裂写</strong>。读优化：leader 租约读（lease-based read）避免每次读都走 quorum。成员变更走 Raft conf change，支持 <strong>learner</strong>（无投票权、追上日志后转正）实现安全加节点。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft (etcd-io/raft standalone library): all writes go through the leader, are fsynced to WAL, replicated to a majority before committing; CP system — during a partition t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Raft (etcd-io/raft standalone library): all writes go through the leader, are fsynced to WAL, replicated to a majority before committing; <strong>CP system</strong> — during a partition the minority side cannot write and linearizable reads fail; <strong>no split-brain writes can occur</strong>. Read optimization: leader lease-based reads avoid going through quorum for every read. Membership changes go through Raft conf change, with <strong>learner</strong> support (no voting rights, promoted once it catches up on the log) for safely adding nodes.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无分片、无横向写扩展</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方推荐 3 或 5 成员，最多 7（再多收益递减、延迟上升）；无分片、无横向写扩展——加成员不增加写吞吐，反而增加 quorum 延迟。扩容=加成员（在线，经 learner），是可用性扩容不是容量扩容。容量靠纵向：调大 --quota-backend-bytes（默认 2GB，建议上限 8GB，超 8GB 启动告警）。部分支持。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>官方推荐 <strong>3 或 5 成员</strong>，最多 7（再多收益递减、延迟上升）；<strong>无分片、无横向写扩展</strong>——加成员不增加写吞吐，反而增加 quorum 延迟。扩容=加成员（在线，经 learner），是可用性扩容不是容量扩容。容量靠纵向：调大 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code>（默认 2GB，建议上限 8GB，超 8GB 启动告警）。<strong>部分支持</strong>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Official recommendation is 3 or 5 members, at most 7 (diminishing returns and rising latency beyond that); no sharding, no horizontal write scaling — adding members does …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Official recommendation is <strong>3 or 5 members</strong>, at most 7 (diminishing returns and rising latency beyond that); <strong>no sharding, no horizontal write scaling</strong> — adding members does not increase write throughput, it increases quorum latency. Expanding = adding members (online, via learner); this is availability scaling, not capacity scaling. Capacity comes vertically: raise <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> (default 2GB, recommended upper limit 8GB, startup warns above 8GB). <strong>Partially supported</strong>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>——10.1 起实例级静态加密：InnoDB 表空间（innodb_encrypt_tables）、redo log（innodb_encrypt_log）、临时文件、binlog（encrypt_binlog，10.5+）；插件式密钥管理：file_key_management（社区版自带，密钥存本地文件，合规性弱）/ A…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>——10.1 起实例级静态加密：InnoDB 表空间（<code>innodb_encrypt_tables</code>）、redo log（<code>innodb_encrypt_log</code>）、临时文件、binlog（<code>encrypt_binlog</code>，10.5+）；插件式密钥管理：file_key_management（社区版自带，密钥存本地文件，合规性弱）/ AWS KMS 插件（企业版限定，GPL 与 AWS SDK 许可证冲突故社区二进制不分发）。<strong>备份文件本身的加密未找到证据</strong>，视为需外部手段解决。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> — instance-level encryption since 10.1: InnoDB tablespaces (innodb_encrypt_tables), redo log (innodb_encrypt_log), temporary files, binlog (encrypt_bi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> — instance-level encryption since 10.1: InnoDB tablespaces (<code>innodb_encrypt_tables</code>), redo log (<code>innodb_encrypt_log</code>), temporary files, binlog (<code>encrypt_binlog</code>, 10.5+); plugin-based key management: file_key_management (bundled with the community edition, keys stored in a local file, weak compliance posture) / AWS KMS plugin (Enterprise-only; not distributed in community binaries due to the GPL vs AWS SDK license conflict). <strong>No evidence found for encryption of backup files themselves</strong> — treat as requiring external measures.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>——社区版原生 TLS，可按用户 REQUIRE SSL/X509 强制或全局 require_secure_transport=ON。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>——社区版原生 TLS，可按用户 <code>REQUIRE SSL/X509</code> 强制或全局 <code>require_secure_transport=ON</code>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes (official docs / community-tested) — community edition has native TLS; enforceable per-user via REQUIRE SSL/X509 or globally with require_secure_transport=ON.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Yes</strong> (official docs / community-tested) — community edition has native TLS; enforceable per-user via <code>REQUIRE SSL/X509</code> or globally with <code>require_secure_transport=ON</code>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>——MySQL 线协议兼容，驱动/ORM/GUI 通用；但 SQL 层&quot;drop-in replacement&quot;已是过时说法。查证缺失的 MySQL 8.x 关键特性：原生二进制 JSON、JSON_TABLE、JSON 多值索引、事务性数据字典、Group Replication、caching_sha2_…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>——MySQL 线协议兼容，驱动/ORM/GUI 通用；但 SQL 层&quot;drop-in replacement&quot;已是过时说法。查证缺失的 MySQL 8.x 关键特性：原生二进制 JSON、JSON_TABLE、JSON 多值索引、事务性数据字典、Group Replication、caching_sha2_password 默认认证。MariaDB 独有：sequences、系统版本表、INSERT...RETURNING、invisible columns、Oracle 兼容模式、VECTOR+HNSW（11.8+，反超 MySQL 一步）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (official docs / community consensus) — MySQL wire-protocol compatible; drivers/ORMs/GUI tools are largely interchangeable; but the SQL-layer &quot;drop-in replacement…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (official docs / community consensus) — MySQL wire-protocol compatible; drivers/ORMs/GUI tools are largely interchangeable; but the SQL-layer &quot;drop-in replacement&quot; claim is outdated. Verified missing MySQL 8.x key features: native binary JSON, JSON_TABLE, JSON multi-valued indexes, transactional data dictionary, Group Replication, caching_sha2_password default authentication. MariaDB-only features: sequences, system-versioned tables, INSERT...RETURNING, invisible columns, Oracle compatibility mode, VECTOR+HNSW (11.8+, one step ahead of MySQL).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档/媒体报道）——社区版 GPLv2；企业版仅向订阅客户分发；MaxScale 等 BSL；订阅制计费（官网未公开价目，待验证）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档/媒体报道）——社区版 GPLv2；企业版仅向订阅客户分发；MaxScale 等 BSL；订阅制计费（官网未公开价目，待验证）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes (official docs / media report) — community edition GPLv2; Enterprise distributed only to subscription customers; MaxScale and others under BSL; subscription-based pri…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Yes</strong> (official docs / media report) — community edition GPLv2; Enterprise distributed only to subscription customers; MaxScale and others under BSL; subscription-based pricing (no public price list on the website, to-be-verified).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>——官方 KB 以英文为主、无官方中文文档；中文内容散见云厂商文档、dbaplus、墨天轮、CSDN，多停留在 10.x 时代；11/12 新特性中文资料稀缺。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>——官方 KB 以英文为主、无官方中文文档；中文内容散见云厂商文档、dbaplus、墨天轮、CSDN，多停留在 10.x 时代；11/12 新特性中文资料稀缺。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> — the official KB is predominantly English with no official Chinese documentation; Chinese content is scattered across cloud vendor docs, db…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> — the official KB is predominantly English with no official Chinese documentation; Chinese content is scattered across cloud vendor docs, dbaplus, MoTianLun, and CSDN, mostly stuck in the 10.x era; Chinese material on 11/12 new features is scarce.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（单机性能与 MySQL 相近；Galera 多写有代价）。 单机 OLTP 与 MySQL 同量级；线程池开源、优化器有差异化特性 社区共识。 Galera 多主写：认证复制有开销，写冲突导致回滚，高冲突负载下不如单主 社区共识。 ColumnStore 做分析，行列混合不如原生 HTAP 一体 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（单机性能与 MySQL 相近；Galera 多写有代价）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单机 OLTP 与 MySQL 同量级；线程池开源、优化器有差异化特性 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Galera 多主写：认证复制有开销，写冲突导致回滚，高冲突负载下不如单主 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ColumnStore 做分析，行列混合不如原生 HTAP 一体 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (single-node close to MySQL; Galera multi-writer has a cost). Single-node OLTP on par with MySQL; open-source thread pool and differentiated optimizer features …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (single-node close to MySQL; Galera multi-writer has a cost).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-node OLTP on par with MySQL; open-source thread pool and differentiated optimizer features <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Galera multi-primary writes: certification replication adds overhead and write conflicts cause rollbacks — worse than single-primary under high-conflict load <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ColumnStore handles analytics; hybrid row/column less integrated than native HTAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mariadb__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（开源无官方认证；企业版走厂商体系）。 社区版：无官方合规认证，合规责任在部署方 社区共识。 MariaDB 企业版/SkySQL 的合规资质以厂商公开页为准 厂商口径。 无信创名录公开信息 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（开源无官方认证；企业版走厂商体系）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>社区版：无官方合规认证，合规责任在部署方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>MariaDB 企业版/SkySQL 的合规资质以厂商公开页为准 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>无信创名录公开信息 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (no official certs for open source; enterprise via vendor). Community edition: no official compliance certifications; deployer responsible (community …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (no official certs for open source; enterprise via vendor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Community edition: no official compliance certifications; deployer responsible <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>MariaDB Enterprise/SkySQL qualifications per the vendor&#x27;s public pages <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>No public trusted-innovation catalog information <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});